From c3942cae8c5d2272dc6fa16e8bc0f60af688073e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:43:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Wire the proactive kernel into Android

loop/proactive adapts the kernel: ProactiveRuntime builds the Gate from
PhoneTasks, PromptArbiter, ProtectedPages, screen, lock, accessibility
and notification state (read only), runs the kernel's commands, and keeps
one main-thread callback at the next deadline plus one alarm for the
scheduler (none when background work is restricted). ProactivePageActivity
is a token-bound page in its own task. ProactivePlugin exposes
dsh/proactive and carries agent HTTP calls to Dart, which holds the
engine cookie; Dart passes raw answers back for AgentWire to decode.

Shared files: PhonePrompts gets a read-only onBusyChanged callback,
MainActivity registers the plugin, the manifest adds the page, the wake
receiver and RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED, and LoopRuntime refreshes the gate
on accessibility and protected-page changes and ticks the kernel on
window changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
